.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Assault Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/953cfdeb2703978b1ab449b991b98989.png","desc":"This shotgun's magazine is optimized for quick combat.\n  •  Greatly increases stability\n  •  Increases rate of fire"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Headstone","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3a705de0f526aea681a5ffd99b400ab8.png","desc":"Precision final blows spawn a [Stasis] Stasis crystal at the victim's location."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Lone Wolf","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4c244b847778a484726543e5c35935ef.png","desc":"Slightly improves aim assist, aim down sights speed, and airborne effectiveness. Increases these effects when there are no nearby allies."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Tunnel Vision","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ab0837be56c8d5cfc474acd4f3f9c7ac.png","desc":"Reloading after defeating a target greatly increases target acquisition and aim down sight speed for a short duration."},{"name":"Pulse Monitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/64642b7455e88ffde77be53ce7cb7c05.png","desc":"Automatically reloads the magazine and improves weapon handling when wounded—even when this weapon is stowed."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Perpetual Motion","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8b9a4582016210723532907414759e69.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus stability, handling, and reload speed while the wielder is in motion."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Rimestealer","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b88380f8b364c2743d53f12d4d98e273.png","desc":"Destroying a Stasis crystal or defeating a frozen target with this weapon grants you Frost Armor."},{"name":"Desperate Measures","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/25692d31f4963c07c3a82aba508b52b6.png","desc":"Weapon final blows grant bonus damage. Melee and grenade final blows grant a larger damage bonus that can stack."},{"name":"Headseeker","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bdca577f8850f3c6168e9bc055019934.png","desc":"Body shots landed with this weapon increase precision damage and aim assist for a short time. Body shots landed while the perk is active refresh the time."},{"name":"Desperado","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1c95bff6fa57919ab0f5547d1f107fad.png","desc":"Reloading after a precision final blow or after rapidly defeating targets increases your rate of fire."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Surrounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/979881b68ca7839267c9aef5aea2b0ce.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus damage when three or more enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Swashbuckler","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/42631a4aff4432e794529a5a707eba61.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage from melee kills and kills with this weapon."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1cb05adef7cf6af6602a0da0.png","desc":"Final blows with other weapons improve this weapon's damage and performance for a short duration."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Headstone","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3a705